WEBVTT

00:00:02.826 --> 00:00:03.680
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> <b>Part 3</b>

00:00:10.008 --> 00:00:13.644
Walid walks for five days through the mountains.

00:00:14.190 --> 00:00:18.701
The sun shines, and at night it’s very cold.

00:00:19.513 --> 00:00:23.367
Then, one evening, he finds the palace.

00:00:24.093 --> 00:00:30.678
The prince welcomes him and gives him food and drink, and a comfortable bed.

00:00:31.655 --> 00:00:39.224
But Walid can’t sleep. He’s thinking about the 1,000 gold coins.

00:00:40.668 --> 00:00:43.537
The next morning, he says to the prince,

00:00:44.871 --> 00:00:52.693
"I want to say thank you to you. Please have this silver ring. It’s my mother’s."

00:00:53.810 --> 00:01:00.927
The prince is very happy. "This is a beautiful ring," he says.

00:01:01.266 --> 00:01:05.572
"Thank you. Let me give you something in return."

00:01:06.624 --> 00:01:14.340
He gives Walid a box. "Don’t open this until you get home," he says.

00:01:14.930 --> 00:01:19.473
"Be careful with it. It’s very, very valuable."

00:01:21.138 --> 00:01:27.784
Walid runs through the mountains, and after three days he arrives home.

00:01:28.902 --> 00:01:33.863
"Where’s my silver ring?" shouts his mother.

00:01:35.225 --> 00:01:41.352
"Don’t worry about your ring!" says Walid. "Look at this!"

00:01:42.783 --> 00:01:53.885
Hassan and their mother watch as he opens the box. Inside he finds the glass bottle.